cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark or code, please cite the repository (a paper citation will be added on publication)."
title: "BanglaHandshape: A Signer-Independent Benchmark for Still-Image Bangla Sign Language Handshape Classification"
abstract: >-
  A signer-independent (SI) benchmark for still-image Bangla Sign Language
  handshape classification. It aggregates public Bangla handshape image datasets
  under an SI protocol, provides a foundation-model-era (DINOv2 / LoRA) baseline
  table across them, and quantifies the signer-dependent to signer-independent
  accuracy drop (the identity shortcut) using per-user leave-one-signer-out
  evaluation and near-duplicate leakage audits.
type: software
authors:
